       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GROUP-SEMANTICS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-CUSTOMER.
          05 WS-NAME PIC X(5) VALUE "AL".
          05 WS-DETAILS.
             10 WS-AGE PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE "BOB" TO WS-NAME OF WS-CUSTOMER.
           MOVE 42 TO WS-AGE.
           DISPLAY WS-NAME OF WS-CUSTOMER.
           DISPLAY WS-AGE.
           IF WS-NAME = "BOB"
               DISPLAY "MATCH"
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
